# SEO

- Public pages go under `app/(marketing)/` with `title`, `description` and `alternates.canonical` in `generateMetadata`.
- Don't set per-page `openGraph` / `twitter` objects: they replace the root ones and drop the share image.
- Add indexable URLs to `sitemap.ts`; private pages get `robots: { index: false }`.

Guide: [docs/agents/seo.md](docs/agents/seo.md)
